feos 0.1.0 - a tiny aarch64 kernel
Serial console: PL011 at 0x0900_0000
Framebuffer: ramfb, 1024x768 XRGB8888
Filesystem: read-only, embedded in the kernel image

The desktop is a session layer above the GUI toolkit. The file explorer is a
foreground app: launch it from the Start menu and press Esc to return.
